<title>UK: KfW unit sets NZ$100 million Eurobond due 2002.</title>
<headline>KfW unit sets NZ$100 million Eurobond due 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU (RATED AAA/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    26.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.10    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		SENIOR, UNSECURED, UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
